  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Helpdesk Democracy and HR 2023-2026 May - Helpdesk services for Dem. and Human Rights 2023-2025 (2026)- Ny strat. 2024</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Helpdesk demokrati och m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter 2023-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Helpdesken erbjuder st&#xf6;d i beredningsprocesser, uppf&#xf6;ljning, strategiprocesser och annat som Sida-personal kan beh&#xf6;va f&#xf6;r att st&#xe4;rka myndighetens arbete i relation till denna tematik och metodst&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r att garantera integreringen av demokrati och r&#xe4;ttighetsperspektiven.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this assignment is to set up and operate a help desk to provide support to Sida&apos;s appraisal, decision-making, dialogue and follow-up processes within the thematic area of Democracy and Human Rights. The support provided will be in the form of short-term services, offered on request from both Sida Head office and Swedish Missions Abroad
This is a call-off under this Framework Agreement, for the on-call provision of short-term Help Desk services to Sida and Swedish Missions Abroad in the sub-areas of: 

1.	Local Democracy and Decentralisation, 
2.	Political Institutions, Political Participation and a Pluralist Civil Society, 
3.	State-building and Public Institutions and Administration,
4.	Public Financial Management,
5.	Human Rights Systems, Human Rights Defenders and Rule of Law, 
6.	Equal Rights and Non-Discrimination, 
7.	Freedom of Expression and Access to Information Online and Offline
8.	Human Rights Based Approach.
Funds for these services will be allocated from the Strategy for Sweden&#x2019;s Development Cooperation in the Areas of Human Rights, Democracy and the Rule of Law, 2018-2022.</narrative>
  </description>
